<Placemark><name>Monumento Natural de las Secuoyas del Monte Cabezón</name><description><![CDATA[Forest walk · Cabezón de la Sal<br>Natural monument of giant sequoias beside the CA-135 road between Cabezón de la Sal and Comillas; the trees can reach over 50 m. A pleasant short outing with a choice of walking routes. Listed in the Cantabria Costa Central visitor leaflet.<br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=43.319598,-4.259381">Open in Google Maps</a> · <a href="https://explorecantabria.fyi/#monumento-natural-de-las-secuoyas-del-monte-cabezon">Open in the map app</a>]]></description><styleUrl>#s-walk</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-4.259381,43.319598,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
